{%- comment -%}
  Custom code before </head>
  Rebuilt 2026-08-02 (post-erase rebuild, phase 1: design system + header/
  footer/home). Loads:
  1. Google Fonts — Italiana (EN display), Karla 300/400/500 (EN body/UI),
     Noto Naskh Arabic 400/500/600 (AR display) and Noto Kufi Arabic
     300/400/500 (AR body) — both languages' fonts are loaded now so the
     later Arabic content-wiring pass does not need to touch typography.
  2. assets/raqi-theme.css — the full Raqi design-system stylesheet
     (palette custom properties, utility classes, header/footer/home
     component styles).
{%- endcomment -%}
